{"title":"Physics summer programs","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>These <b>physics summer programs</b> are for North American students, but programs in other nations can be added.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Canada_Physics_Summer_Programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Canada Physics Summer Programs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#U.S._Physics_Summer_Programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">U.S. Physics Summer Programs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Elementary_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elementary school</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Middle_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Middle school</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#High_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">High school</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Collegiate\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Collegiate</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Canada_Physics_Summer_Programs\">Canada Physics Summer Programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Canada Physics Summer Programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Machine_Learning_Bootcamp\">MehtA+ AI/Machine Learning Bootcamp</a> is a virtual research program for grades 8-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-ml-research-bootcamp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=POPTOR&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"POPTOR (page does not exist)\">POPTOR</a> physics Olympiad training <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www2.physics.utoronto.ca/~poptor/\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"U.S._Physics_Summer_Programs\">U.S. Physics Summer Programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: U.S. Physics Summer Programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elementary_school\">Elementary school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Elementary school\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (CTY) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.jhu.edu/gifted/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Middle_school\">Middle school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Middle school\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (CTY) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.jhu.edu/gifted/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CyberMath_Academy\" title=\"CyberMath Academy\">CyberMath Academy</a> (Boston-Harvard Univ., Silicon Valley-Stanford Univ.) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cybermath.org/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Machine_Learning_Bootcamp\">MehtA+ AI/Machine Learning Bootcamp</a> is a virtual research program for grades 8-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-ml-research-bootcamp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sally_Ride_Science_Camps&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Sally Ride Science Camps (page does not exist)\">Sally Ride Science Camps</a> for girls.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.educationunlimited.com/sallyride/science.html\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"High_school\">High school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: High school\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CASPER&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CASPER (page does not exist)\">CASPER</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.baylor.edu/casper/index.php?id=20537\">High School Scholars Program</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Baylor_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Baylor University (page does not exist)\">Baylor University</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://everaise.org/\">Everaise Academy</a> Online Camp (Currently don't work since 2022)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CyberMath_Academy\" title=\"CyberMath Academy\">CyberMath Academy</a> (Boston-Harvard Univ.) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cybermath.org/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Summer_School_for_Young_Physicists\" title=\"International Summer School for Young Physicists\">International Summer School for Young Physicists</a> (ISSYP) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://perimeterinstitute.ca/issyp\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Machine_Learning_Bootcamp\">MehtA+ AI/Machine Learning Bootcamp</a> is a virtual research program for grades 8-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-ml-research-bootcamp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=National_Youth_Science_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"National Youth Science Camp (page does not exist)\">National Youth Science Camp</a> (NYSC) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nysc.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nscl.msu.edu/teachersstudents/programs/pan\">PAN: Physics of Atomic Nuclei at NSCL</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.aapt.org/Contests/olympiad.cfm\">Physics Olympiad Training Program</a> (by qualification through the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=United_States_Physics_Olympiad\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"United States Physics Olympiad\">United States Physics Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving%27s_8-month_online_Olympiad-level_physics_course_(PhysicsWOOT)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving&#39;s 8-month online Olympiad-level physics course (PhysicsWOOT) (page does not exist)\">Art of Problem Solving's 8-month online Olympiad-level physics course (PhysicsWOOT)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/school/course/catalog/woot-physics\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://physics.bu.edu/BU/hsprograms/rip.html\">Research Internships</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Boston_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Boston University (page does not exist)\">Boston University</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sally_Ride_Science_Camps&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Sally Ride Science Camps (page does not exist)\">Sally Ride Science Camps</a> for girls <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.educationunlimited.com/sallyride/science.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://talariasummerinstitute.org/\">Talaria Summer Institute</a> is a free summer STEM research mentorship program for female and genderqueer students</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yale_Summer_Program_in_Astrophysics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Yale Summer Program in Astrophysics (page does not exist)\">Yale Summer Program in Astrophysics</a> (YSPA) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://yspa.yale.edu/\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Collegiate\">Collegiate</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Collegiate\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Machine_Learning_Bootcamp\">MehtA+ AI/Machine Learning Bootcamp</a> is a virtual research program for grades 8-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-ml-research-bootcamp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://physics.uchicago.edu/reu_phys1.html\">Summer Research Experiences for Undergraduates</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Chicago&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of Chicago (page does not exist)\">University of Chicago</a> (for women and minorities)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://go.iqc.ca/useqip\">Undergraduate School on Experimental Quantum Information Processing (USEQIP)</a> at <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.iqc.ca\">Institute for Quantum Computing</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.uwaterloo.ca\">University of Waterloo</a>, Canada.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_summer_programs\" title=\"Academic summer programs\">Academic summer programs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_summer_programs\" title=\"Science summer programs\">Science summer programs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_books\" title=\"Physics books\">Physics books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_scholarships\" title=\"Physics scholarships\">Physics scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_competitions\" title=\"Physics competitions\">Physics competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018103047\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 37/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2059:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018103047 and revision id 216415. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}